[5.345,"o","\r\n╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║  COMMIT BLOCKED — No gate session found                 ║\r\n╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣\r\n║                                                          ║\r\n║  Create a gate session and register required reviews     ║\r\n║  before committing. Use the MCP convention-gate tools:   ║\r\n║                                                          ║\r\n║    1. create_gate_session({ description: \"...\" })        ║\r\n║    2. register_gate({ session_id, gate_name, result })   ║\r\n║    3. git commit (this hook checks automatically)        ║\r\n║                                                          ║\r\n║  To bypass: GATE_BYPASS=1 git commit                     ║\r\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\r\n"]
